n the  neurons were treated with media  containing interferon gamma released  from activated microglia after treatment  with neuro melanin alpha-synuclein neuro  melanin plus alpha synuclein nitrated  alpha-synuclein and muted in alpha  synuclein caused increased expression of  MCH one also if neutralizing antibody  for interferon gamma is added to the  culture decreased expression of MHC 1 on  neurons was observed this data is not  shown here these data demonstrate the  expression of MHC 1 on neurons under  various conditions in the absence of  microglia addition of l-dopa which is a  precursor of dopamine and produces neuro  melanin increases expression of MHC 1 in  dopaminergic neurons oh album in which  is a 385 amino acid for and protein can  be cleaved to an eight amino acid  peptide wended dendritic cells and other  antigen presenting cells when the  ovalbumin is added to the culture the  peptide is processed inside the cells  and the MHC one with the peptide it  displayed on the surface peptide with  interferon gamma is also used as control  here  when dopaminergic neurons grown in the  presence of the peptide 41 cytotoxic  cells and interferon-gamma more than  fifty percent of the cells died while  knockout of MHC one protected the cells  indicating that the neuronal cell death  is due to the MHC one expression on the  surface in a similar experiment when  dopaminergic neurons are incubated with  media from activated microglia similar  cell death was seen confirming activated  microglia mediated neuronal cell death  in the presence of t-cells so the  authors conclusively established  expression of MHC on the neuronal  surface under various conditions and  examine the possibility of neuronal cell  death by immune cells next let's look at  another publication this one is from lMC  Dickie slab published in pnas the paper  talks about the mechanism by which  hepatitis C survives in the body the  authors demonstrate that hepatitis C  virus induces mitochondrial 